<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>10 / 待深化研究</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>方向 6（学生侧）：错误传播分析</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#98A2B3' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>待研究</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 16 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={1140} height={210} viewBox='0 0 1140 210'><rect x='40' y='30' width='280' height='120' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E9E62' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='180' y='62' font-size='18' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>正确解：a = 2</text><text x='180' y='100' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>第 1 步（正确）</text><line x1='320' y1='90' x2='392' y2='90' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='392' y='30' width='320' height='120' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#E8A33D' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='552' y='62' font-size='18' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>学生算成：a = 3</text><text x='552' y='100' font-size='15' fill='#E8A33D' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>第 2 步（直接错误）</text><line x1='712' y1='90' x2='784' y2='90' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='784' y='30' width='320' height='120' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='944' y='62' font-size='18' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>a + 1 = 4</text><text x='944' y='100' font-size='15' fill='#1E7BE0' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>第 3 步（条件性正确）</text><text x='570' y='180' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>四类结果：直接错误 · 条件性正确 · 连带结果 · 新的独立错误</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E7BE0', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>不适合机械沿用错误结果的四种情形：改变定义域、造成除零或无意义量、使所用定理不再适用、中途引入新的独立错误。参考 Numbas 的 adaptive marking，但该机制面向预定义题部分，不能直接解决自由手写多解法</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：待深化功能研究.md §3.1–§3.2</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 99 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>